WEBVTT

00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:25.560
Young master.

00:00:29.030 --> 00:00:30.330
It's morning.

00:00:31.370 --> 00:00:32.420
Who are you?

00:00:35.770 --> 00:00:37.770
You must still be half-asleep.

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:41.700
Lilith.

00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:42.630
Yes.

00:00:42.630 --> 00:00:44.860
Good morning, young master.

00:00:45.130 --> 00:00:48.330
I thought you had today off.

00:00:53.830 --> 00:00:58.160
E-Even so, I can't neglect 
my morning duties.

00:01:02.980 --> 00:01:05.630
I'll prepare breakfast right away.

00:01:05.830 --> 00:01:06.650
Okay.

00:01:15.410 --> 00:01:17.360
Who was that girl?

00:01:30.310 --> 00:01:35.280
<b>The Maid I Hired Recently
Is Mysterious</b>

00:02:49.770 --> 00:02:54.520
<b>Episode 8: The Girl With the Purple Eyes</b>

00:02:53.880 --> 00:02:56.010
Pardon me, young master.

00:03:07.480 --> 00:03:10.450
<i>Why is she all dressed up?</i>

00:03:10.450 --> 00:03:12.120
<i>Is she meeting someone?</i>

00:03:12.980 --> 00:03:15.450
<i>It's not... a date, is it?!</i>

00:03:16.390 --> 00:03:20.920
Young master, are you sure 
I may really take the day off?

00:03:20.920 --> 00:03:22.540
O-Of course.

00:03:22.830 --> 00:03:27.180
It's part of a master's job to 
allow his servants to take breaks.

00:03:27.590 --> 00:03:29.060
Understood.

00:03:29.300 --> 00:03:32.720
I shall take you up on the offer.

00:03:54.100 --> 00:03:57.730
<i>I still have some time until our meeting.</i>

00:03:57.730 --> 00:03:59.420
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:04:01.920 --> 00:04:03.270
<i>Something smells nice.</i>

00:04:03.700 --> 00:04:04.970
<i>What could it be?</i>

00:04:18.890 --> 00:04:20.130
Welcome.

00:04:23.420 --> 00:04:24.980
<i>That looks delicious.</i>

00:04:25.250 --> 00:04:29.410
<i>I think I'll buy some for the young master.</i>

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:33.240
<i>He likes sweet bread.</i>

00:04:33.240 --> 00:04:35.860
<i>These chocolate strawberry krones,</i>

00:04:35.860 --> 00:04:39.490
<i>and these seasonal Marron Danishes...</i>

00:04:39.490 --> 00:04:41.920
<i>Croissants are a must-have, too.</i>

00:04:42.570 --> 00:04:45.040
Would you like to try a sample?

00:04:45.040 --> 00:04:47.100
Thank you.

00:04:51.030 --> 00:04:52.860
It's very delicious.

00:04:53.710 --> 00:04:54.740
I'm glad.

00:04:57.530 --> 00:04:59.030
Is something the matter?

00:04:59.030 --> 00:05:01.490
No, it's nothing.

00:05:13.350 --> 00:05:14.960
Wait!

00:05:15.250 --> 00:05:18.120
But I can't wait to show Mom.

00:05:34.720 --> 00:05:38.510
<i>I wonder if the young master 
is doing all right by himself.</i>

00:05:38.770 --> 00:05:41.660
<i>I hope he's had his meal.</i>

00:05:41.660 --> 00:05:44.350
<i>I hope he's not in any trouble.</i>

00:05:44.810 --> 00:05:47.010
<i>I'm so worried.</i>

00:05:48.250 --> 00:05:50.450
Worrying about your master again?

00:05:50.680 --> 00:05:51.890
Fujisaki-san.

00:05:52.330 --> 00:05:54.650
I apologize for being late.

00:05:54.940 --> 00:05:57.630
Thank you for coming.

00:05:57.630 --> 00:06:00.640
Actually, I'm off duty today, as well.

00:06:01.080 --> 00:06:02.440
Welcome.

00:06:02.440 --> 00:06:04.370
Have you decided what to order?

00:06:04.370 --> 00:06:05.990
I'll have what she had.

00:06:05.990 --> 00:06:07.500
Understood.

00:06:08.680 --> 00:06:16.420
I do wonder, though, if you really ought to 
be worrying about your master on your day off.

00:06:16.740 --> 00:06:17.740
Yes...

00:06:18.320 --> 00:06:22.700
Don't you ever get worried 
about Gojouin-sama?

00:06:22.700 --> 00:06:23.940
Not at all.

00:06:27.150 --> 00:06:28.640
I see...

00:06:29.080 --> 00:06:32.390
I suppose it must be because 
of your long-standing bond.

00:06:32.390 --> 00:06:34.840
Does it all seem so nice to you?

00:06:34.840 --> 00:06:37.660
My situation can't be 
much different from yours.

00:06:38.070 --> 00:06:39.760
It's very different.

00:06:40.670 --> 00:06:43.390
Setting aside the time you've already had,

00:06:43.390 --> 00:06:47.540
I still haven't fully opened 
my young master's heart.

00:06:48.680 --> 00:06:49.940
Even this morning...

00:06:52.990 --> 00:06:55.980
I don't think you need to be so anxious.

00:07:01.330 --> 00:07:04.290
You sure have changed, Fujisaki-san.

00:07:05.240 --> 00:07:09.660
I heard lots of rumors about you 
during our time at the academy.

00:07:10.360 --> 00:07:15.620
That you were the worst student at school, 
until you suddenly changed one day.

00:07:16.420 --> 00:07:22.120
I thought it was just a rumor at the time, 
but having met you again, I'm certain of it.

00:07:23.100 --> 00:07:27.180
You must have changed when 
you met Gojouin-sama.

00:07:28.140 --> 00:07:31.200
The air around you is very tender.

00:07:31.200 --> 00:07:32.560
Would you please stop?

00:07:33.560 --> 00:07:35.090
This is embarrassing for me.

00:07:35.090 --> 00:07:36.860
I-I'm sorry.

00:07:38.430 --> 00:07:42.320
Anyway, I truly admire the two of you.

00:07:43.450 --> 00:07:46.510
How can I become like you two?

00:07:47.720 --> 00:07:52.360
To me, the two of you 
seem far more admirable.

00:07:52.570 --> 00:07:57.320
The young lady is very interested 
in your relationship, as well.

00:07:58.010 --> 00:08:00.210
But, well...

00:08:00.550 --> 00:08:03.460
If I were to give you any advice,

00:08:04.050 --> 00:08:08.260
I would say that what's important is 
for you to open your own heart.

00:08:12.120 --> 00:08:16.400
I'm sure your master will
 open his heart to you then.

00:08:17.450 --> 00:08:20.590
I don't know if I can do it.

00:08:49.360 --> 00:08:51.820
When we were at the academy,

00:08:51.820 --> 00:08:55.620
you seemed to be burdened with a 
different kind of loneliness than mine.

00:08:56.940 --> 00:09:01.290
You had such an 
unapproachable air about you,

00:09:01.290 --> 00:09:03.850
and yet you've come to talk to me.

00:09:04.920 --> 00:09:08.890
I think you've already begun to change.

00:09:12.760 --> 00:09:14.050
Excuse me.

00:09:15.820 --> 00:09:18.890
<b>Hurry!! Hurry up and show me
 the picture you took with her!</b>

00:09:15.820 --> 00:09:18.950
<b>Understood. I will contact you later.</b>

00:09:15.820 --> 00:09:18.950
<b>Tsukasa</b>

00:09:15.830 --> 00:09:19.240
<i>Hurry! Hurry up and show me 
the picture you took with her!</i>

00:09:19.120 --> 00:09:23.520
<b>Give me details of what you talked
 about with the maid when 
you get home!</b>

00:09:19.240 --> 00:09:23.580
<i>Give me details of what you talked 
about with the maid when you get home!</i>

00:09:23.580 --> 00:09:24.830
<i>Was it about romance?</i>

00:09:23.750 --> 00:09:24.640
<b>Was it about romance?</b>

00:09:24.830 --> 00:09:26.710
<i>I want to join, too!</i>

00:09:24.910 --> 00:09:26.710
<b>I want to join, too!</b>

00:09:26.710 --> 00:09:28.480
<i>If you're talking about romance,</i>

00:09:28.480 --> 00:09:31.540
<i>I have some questions I'd 
like you to ask her for me.</i>

00:09:29.670 --> 00:09:31.140
What is it?

00:09:31.480 --> 00:09:34.510
I apologize. The young lady is calling for me.

00:09:34.510 --> 00:09:36.190
I must be going.

00:09:37.840 --> 00:09:41.390
So you do worry about Gojouin-sama.

00:09:42.800 --> 00:09:47.450
I-In any case, I enjoyed talking 
about old times today.

00:09:50.010 --> 00:09:52.640
You haven't talked to your 
master yet, have you?

00:09:53.600 --> 00:09:58.780
I think you have what it 
takes to tell him now.

00:10:08.810 --> 00:10:10.370
<i>Talked?</i>

00:10:10.370 --> 00:10:11.840
<i>Talked about what?</i>

00:10:12.910 --> 00:10:15.760
<i>I couldn't help but follow her here.</i>

00:10:16.870 --> 00:10:20.740
<i>Is Lilith hiding something from me?</i>

00:10:21.130 --> 00:10:22.580
<i>Something I don't know about?</i>

00:10:26.080 --> 00:10:27.370
Oh, dear.

00:10:31.920 --> 00:10:38.450
<i>So that I can shine by your side</i>

00:10:39.270 --> 00:10:45.110
<i>In the future that is yet to come</i>

00:10:46.820 --> 00:10:54.420
<i>I continue to search</i>

00:10:54.420 --> 00:11:04.690
<i>And walk on beyond the rainbow</i>

00:11:09.980 --> 00:11:12.780
Young master, I've returned home.

00:11:13.400 --> 00:11:15.980
I bought lots of gifts.

00:11:19.210 --> 00:11:21.030
Is something the matter?

00:11:21.450 --> 00:11:23.720
Your eyes seem even more intense than usual.

00:11:24.310 --> 00:11:27.030
Is there something you 
want to tell me about?

00:11:27.660 --> 00:11:29.580
What is the "talk"?

00:11:30.620 --> 00:11:31.970
The "talk"?

00:11:31.970 --> 00:11:34.080
That's right, the talk.

00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:37.220
Which talk are you talking about?

00:11:37.220 --> 00:11:38.670
Something important!

00:11:39.740 --> 00:11:41.250
Important?

00:11:44.050 --> 00:11:46.660
I'll be making Hamburg 
steaks for dinner tonight.

00:11:46.660 --> 00:11:47.760
No!

00:11:47.760 --> 00:11:50.110
Would that not be to your liking?

00:11:50.110 --> 00:11:52.120
I'll make something else, then.

00:11:52.120 --> 00:11:53.440
That's not it.

00:11:53.440 --> 00:11:54.800
I like Hamburg steaks.

00:11:55.630 --> 00:11:58.520
I like them really juicy.

00:11:59.720 --> 00:12:01.280
Understood.

00:12:01.280 --> 00:12:02.860
No, I mean...

00:12:04.110 --> 00:12:07.920
Isn't there something more important 
that you're keeping from me?

00:12:08.400 --> 00:12:10.950
An important secret?

00:12:11.450 --> 00:12:15.180
You were talking to the Gojouin 
butler today, weren't you?

00:12:15.960 --> 00:12:17.310
How did you...

00:12:19.810 --> 00:12:23.360
Were you following me?

00:12:23.360 --> 00:12:24.320
Yeah.

00:12:25.020 --> 00:12:27.170
I couldn't help but be curious.

00:12:27.170 --> 00:12:31.580
You were dressed cuter than 
ever when you left the house.

00:12:32.500 --> 00:12:35.790
You're always in your maid 
outfit around me. It's not fair.

00:12:35.790 --> 00:12:38.340
Who were you meeting? Where?

00:12:38.340 --> 00:12:40.520
Why wasn't it with me?

00:12:40.520 --> 00:12:41.700
Young master...

00:12:42.210 --> 00:12:46.710
And you were discussing telling me
 <i>something</i>, and it sounded important.

00:12:51.450 --> 00:12:52.560
Sorry.

00:12:54.140 --> 00:12:59.500
Lilith, when she said something 
about telling me something...

00:13:00.030 --> 00:13:03.220
Was it about how you met me in the past?

00:13:06.010 --> 00:13:07.810
How did you know?

00:13:09.160 --> 00:13:13.370
I remembered a little bit 
about when I was little.

00:13:14.150 --> 00:13:17.630
About the girl my parents 
brought to this mansion.

00:13:18.920 --> 00:13:21.880
She looked nothing like she does now...

00:13:28.980 --> 00:13:33.370
But that girl was you, wasn't she?

00:13:37.440 --> 00:13:38.580
That song, too.

00:13:38.930 --> 00:13:42.210
You sang it for me in my mother's place.

00:13:42.840 --> 00:13:44.070
Isn't that right?

00:13:47.530 --> 00:13:48.420
Yes.

00:13:49.840 --> 00:13:52.510
Why did you keep something 
so important from me?!

00:13:54.040 --> 00:13:55.240
Because...

00:13:56.170 --> 00:14:00.230
What's important is for you 
to open your own heart.

00:14:02.170 --> 00:14:07.410
You'll think I'm an awful 
person if I tell you.

00:14:08.130 --> 00:14:10.700
In fact, you might come to hate me.

00:14:10.700 --> 00:14:11.900
No, I won't!

00:14:14.190 --> 00:14:18.610
I thought I should tell 
you in the beginning.

00:14:19.430 --> 00:14:24.050
But I wanted you to remember it on your own.

00:14:26.010 --> 00:14:29.060
What if, even after I told you, 
you still didn't remember?

00:14:29.500 --> 00:14:34.150
That thought kept me from bringing it up.

00:14:35.670 --> 00:14:36.760
I remembered.

00:14:37.320 --> 00:14:39.020
I remembered, Lilith.

00:14:39.490 --> 00:14:44.510
I'm going to remember everything 
about you that I've forgotten, too.

00:14:44.510 --> 00:14:48.110
So don't look so sad.

00:15:12.960 --> 00:15:14.200
Young master?

00:15:15.160 --> 00:15:17.440
<i>Where has he gone?</i>

00:15:23.640 --> 00:15:24.890
Young master?

00:15:24.890 --> 00:15:27.250
What are you up to this early in the morning?

00:15:27.250 --> 00:15:29.200
Lilith. Perfect timing.

00:15:29.580 --> 00:15:30.850
Give me your hand.

00:15:30.850 --> 00:15:32.600
My hand?

00:15:39.130 --> 00:15:41.550
Y-Young master, this is...

00:15:43.470 --> 00:15:45.290
That doesn't work, huh?

00:15:45.290 --> 00:15:46.880
D-Doesn't work?

00:15:46.880 --> 00:15:48.620
It's not that it doesn't work...

00:15:48.620 --> 00:15:50.660
I mean, it doesn't, but...

00:15:50.660 --> 00:15:56.070
I thought I might remember more about 
you if I did something I did that day.

00:15:57.670 --> 00:15:58.850
That day...

00:16:05.210 --> 00:16:06.490
Young master...

00:16:08.340 --> 00:16:11.260
Young master, we should get ready now.

00:16:11.260 --> 00:16:13.030
You'll be late for school.

00:16:13.030 --> 00:16:14.270
Shoot!

00:16:14.270 --> 00:16:15.550
We have to hurry, Lilith.

00:16:15.550 --> 00:16:17.150
Let's continue when I get home.

00:16:17.150 --> 00:16:17.910
Right.

00:16:21.940 --> 00:16:23.210
<i>Continue?</i>

00:16:30.970 --> 00:16:33.050
Good morning.

00:16:32.560 --> 00:16:33.970
Good morning.

00:16:35.330 --> 00:16:37.250
Morning, Gojouin.

00:16:37.250 --> 00:16:39.180
G-Good morning.

00:16:39.770 --> 00:16:43.350
<i>Has something good
 happened to Yuuri-san?</i>

00:16:52.660 --> 00:16:55.370
I don't want it to wilt.

00:16:55.370 --> 00:16:56.920
I think I'll make it a bookmark.

00:17:08.130 --> 00:17:09.580
All right, then...

00:17:09.580 --> 00:17:13.330
How about we start taking answers 
from the back row today?

00:17:16.700 --> 00:17:17.930
Yuuri-san!

00:17:17.930 --> 00:17:21.720
Could it be that you've made some 
kind of progress with your maid?

00:17:22.760 --> 00:17:25.130
How disgraceful of me!

00:17:25.130 --> 00:17:27.540
I only meant to watch from afar, but...

00:17:27.540 --> 00:17:29.110
I want the goods!

00:17:29.110 --> 00:17:30.430
Goods?

00:17:31.210 --> 00:17:38.480
O-Oh, it's just that you seem to 
be in a good mood today, so...

00:17:38.480 --> 00:17:42.560
I thought maybe you'd made some progress 
in your relationship with your maid.

00:17:43.420 --> 00:17:45.620
You're in love.

00:17:46.130 --> 00:17:50.510
<i>I was so busy trying to remember 
about Lilith, I'd totally forgotten.</i>

00:17:50.790 --> 00:17:53.130
So something really did happen?

00:17:53.130 --> 00:17:54.990
Please tell me about it!

00:17:54.990 --> 00:17:57.320
Wh-What do you want to know?

00:17:57.320 --> 00:17:59.170
It can be anything!

00:17:59.170 --> 00:18:01.140
Anything that happened with the maid.

00:18:04.360 --> 00:18:06.300
We slept together.

00:18:08.190 --> 00:18:12.870
We slept together.

00:18:14.980 --> 00:18:18.970
<i>Yuuri-san's climbed the stairs to adulthood.</i>

00:18:21.210 --> 00:18:24.210
So when did you confess?

00:18:24.210 --> 00:18:25.590
Confess?

00:18:29.500 --> 00:18:35.000
D-Don't tell me you s-s-s-s-s-s-s-s-slept 
with her without even confessing to her!

00:18:35.000 --> 00:18:37.390
You've gotten things in the wrong order!

00:18:37.390 --> 00:18:38.760
What do you mean, confess?

00:18:38.760 --> 00:18:41.440
Confess your love, of course!

00:18:42.100 --> 00:18:44.250
It's not love or romance or anything...

00:18:44.250 --> 00:18:46.770
I'm just really suspicious of Lilith.

00:18:46.770 --> 00:18:48.600
That's why I want to get to know her better.

00:18:48.600 --> 00:18:50.030
Oh, you...

00:18:50.030 --> 00:18:51.640
You realize it, don't you?

00:18:51.910 --> 00:18:56.090
That you're in love with your maid.

00:18:59.970 --> 00:19:01.710
Me? With Lilith?

00:19:01.710 --> 00:19:02.830
That's right!

00:19:02.830 --> 00:19:06.360
You can't help but want 
to know more about her.

00:19:06.360 --> 00:19:09.130
That's because you love her.

00:19:13.280 --> 00:19:18.940
<i>So the reason I've been wanting to 
learn more about her all this time...</i>

00:19:20.570 --> 00:19:24.570
<i>This feeling I thought was suspicion...</i>

00:19:35.240 --> 00:19:36.440
Yuuri-san?

00:19:36.440 --> 00:19:38.100
Thanks, Gojouin.

00:19:38.500 --> 00:19:40.060
I have to go!

00:19:41.100 --> 00:19:43.480
Wait, please! I want to go, too!

00:19:44.940 --> 00:19:48.490
Young lady, how long are you 
going to keep me waiting?

00:19:48.740 --> 00:19:50.560
You have lessons today.

00:19:51.570 --> 00:19:53.950
But it was just getting good!

00:19:56.570 --> 00:19:57.760
<i>I see.</i>

00:19:57.760 --> 00:19:59.080
<i>So that's why!</i>

00:19:59.910 --> 00:20:03.810
<i>I was always so anxious over 
what I didn't know about Lilith.</i>

00:20:05.870 --> 00:20:08.030
<i>Lilith was anxious, too,</i>

00:20:08.420 --> 00:20:11.180
<i>that I might not remember her.</i>

00:20:11.900 --> 00:20:14.120
<i>And I've thought she was
 suspicious this whole time.</i>

00:20:14.760 --> 00:20:15.730
<i>I still do.</i>

00:20:16.660 --> 00:20:17.930
<i>I have to tell her.</i>

00:20:17.930 --> 00:20:19.170
<i>Right now!</i>

00:20:27.360 --> 00:20:28.480
I...

00:20:30.330 --> 00:20:31.380
I'm...

00:20:32.560 --> 00:20:34.360
in love with you.

00:20:36.740 --> 00:20:38.710
I love you so much that

00:20:38.710 --> 00:20:40.750
even when you're cleaning, my eyes follow you.

00:20:42.250 --> 00:20:45.200
I love your voice when 
you wake me each morning...

00:20:45.200 --> 00:20:48.770
Your gentle voice when you sing me lullabies...

00:20:49.170 --> 00:20:53.560
The way you buy me things, 
even on your days off...

00:20:54.080 --> 00:20:57.740
I love how your smile is 
like the sun shining on me.

00:20:58.210 --> 00:21:00.460
I love your amused laughter.

00:21:00.800 --> 00:21:04.690
I love your beautiful eyes that 
draw me in with their sparkle.

00:21:09.330 --> 00:21:11.860
I love everything about you.

00:21:19.930 --> 00:21:23.560
Young master, I...

00:21:25.410 --> 00:21:31.160
You're nothing but talk, aren't you?

00:21:31.160 --> 00:21:32.500
Wh-Who are you?

00:21:32.500 --> 00:21:36.060
I have some business with that maid there.

00:21:37.030 --> 00:21:41.870
Lilith, leave this mansion and 
return to my place at once!

00:21:41.870 --> 00:21:43.340
Wh-What?!

00:21:44.930 --> 00:21:46.170
Natsume...

00:23:19.000 --> 00:23:23.990
<b>Next Time
Episode 9: Complicated, Convoluted, Perplexing, Honest Feelings</b>
